      },
      "change": {
        "type": "migration-required"
      },
      "statement": "From 1.12.6 to 1.13.0, the storage version of the updaterequests.kyverno.io CRD moves from v1beta1 to v2. Existing UpdateRequest objects stay stored as v1beta1 until they are rewritten, so a storage version migration and an update of status.storedVersions are needed before a later release removes v1beta1."
